WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.672
Today we will explore repeated structure through weaving. Our work connects with

00:00:04.672 --> 00:00:06.536
Ghanaian and other African artists.

00:00:07.367 --> 00:00:10.247
Lay parallel paper strips on a desk as the base.

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:15.987
Pass one strip over then under the base strips. Record why your chosen technique

00:00:15.987 --> 00:00:16.977
suits the message.

00:00:17.783 --> 00:00:20.557
Repeat the sequence and straighten the finished pattern.
